<title>ITALY: Italy's Sirti in accord with TV Cavo.</title>
<headline>Italy's Sirti in accord with TV Cavo.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian cablemaker Sirti, which is a unit of state telecommunications holding Stet, has signed a contract with Portugal's TV Cavo worth 50 billion lire, a Sirti statement said.</p>
<p>The accord, between Sirti Portugal and TV Cavo, a unit of Telecom Portugal, which operates in the cable television sector, represents a continuation of a contract reached in 1994 and allows it to cover a million connected houses.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
